			"notes": "## Qazr Addons 0.1.4\n\n**`MaceAttect` is now `Smasher`.** `Sustained Drain`, `Cave Safe` and `Max Sustained Hits` were removed, along with the sustain chain state machine, the cave climb helpers, `macekill/CaveBurst.java`, the `CaveBurstSimulation` harness and the `caveBurstSimulation` Gradle task. The totem-bypass smash is now a single pierce burst (roofs are pierced; the whole height list lands in one tick).\n\nRemoved modules: `MaceAura` and `NearestPlayerHUD` (plus the previously removed `MaceMissLite`, `TpMace`, `XinTpMace`, `MaceDMG`, `AntiAirMiss`, `AutoRise`, `AutoTotemToHotbar`). **23 modules** are registered.\n\n### Downloads\n\n| File | Minecraft | Build |\n|------|-----------|-------|\n| `qazr-addons-26.3-1.0.0.jar` | **26.3** | official mappings, Java 25, Fabric Loader 0.19.5, Meteor 26.3-SNAPSHOT (branch `26.3`) |\n| `Qazr-Addons-1.21.11-1.0.0.jar` | **1.21.11** | Yarn 1.21.11+build.3, Java 21, Fabric Loader 0.18.6, Meteor 0.18.6 (branch `main`) |\n\nPick the jar that matches your Minecraft version and drop it into `.minecraft/mods` alongside Meteor Client.\n\nSee `docs/overview.md` for the full module list; removal history is documented in `docs/problems.md`."
		},
